            <ArticleTitle>Immunological studies with aortic and venous tissue antigens. II. Antibodies to vascular antigens.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>89-92</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In the sera of patients with different clinical manifestations of arteriosclerosis antibodies were demonstrated against the CTC-extract in about 50 p. 100 of the cases. Using venous CTC-extracts positive results were obtained in patients with phlebothrombosis in 70 p. 100 of the cases. Cross reactions between the aortic and venous tissues were not detected.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
